<One sentence: what it is, platform, for whom.> **Version <x.y.z> · status: <phase / round>.**

This file holds what every change must respect (≤ 200 lines). Reference material:

| Doc | What's in it | Update when |
|---|---|---|
| `docs/CONTRACTS.md` | Binding public APIs (core types, services, settings, test hooks) | Before changing an API |
| `docs/ROADMAP.md` | Parity board / gap list with status + priority | A feature lands or is dropped |
| `docs/UX.md` | Visual / motion spec | A screen changes |
| `docs/DECISIONS.md` | Owner decisions, dated | The owner decides something |
| `SCORECARD.md` | Performance, sanitizer, test results | After each quality pass |
| `README.md` | Short user guide | User-visible behaviour changes |

