## 4. Engineering rules (binding)
Concurrency · code style · energy budget · privacy & permissions · settings UX · signing.

## 5. Testing — definition of done
1. Unit tests green (new pure logic tested). 2. `scripts/check.sh --ui` green. 3. Used like a user in the installed
build via test hooks, result observed, edge cases covered. 4. Roadmap / contracts updated. 5. No energy regression.
Test-hook table.

## 6. Working agreements
Contract first · parallel agents only for large independent slices (ownership, own build dir, app lock) · usage budget ·
git (commit when asked, checkpoint per slice) · never harm the owner's data · learning loop → app-dev-playbook skill.
